        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/witcher-3-geralt-songs-of-past-expansion.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/the-witcher-3-wild-hunt\">The Witcher 3</a> expansion Songs of the Past - which is due to arrive 12 years after the base game was released - has finally been detailed in a debut trailer, but the surprise news is there's also a The Witcher 3 - Remastered edition coming that considerably overhauls the game, and it'll be a free upgrade for all existing owners of the game. Remastered comes on 29th September, and it's coming to <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/platforms/switch-2\">Switch 2</a> and Battle.net for the first time.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/witcher-3-expansion-songs-of-the-past-trailer\">Read more</a></p>",
