        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-6-ultimate-screen-crop-1.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Discord has said that it has not yet been served a subpoena from Take-Two regarding <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-everything-we-know-so-far-9357\">Grand Theft Auto 6</a> leaks. On Friday, it was reported that <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/take-two-legal-action-gta-6-leeks-cyberleek\">the Rockstar parent company filed multiple subpoenas in a federal district court</a> in order to obtain a wide range of user data from Discord and Microsoft relating to the leaks.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/take-two-rockstar-gta-6-leaks-subpoena-discord-response\">Read more</a></p>",
